Instructions:
The goal of the game is to destroy all zombies and monsters.
Find new weapons in the boxes.
Upgrade characters and weapons to defeat strong enemies.

Q (K) - change weapons;
W, A, S, D (arrows) - move;
E (M) - apply / activate;
F (J) - super weapon.
X, Space (L, KeyPad 0) - shooting;
Mouse - look / shoot;
For mobile devices, use touch input.

On a mobile device:
- Character rotation - swipe from the right side of the screen;
- Character movement - virtual joystick on the left;
- Interact with items - tap the icon in the center of the screen;
- Menu navigation - tap the buttons.

On a desktop:
- Character rotation - mouse movement;
- Character movement - WASD keys;
- Interact with items - E key or left mouse button;
- Hint - H key;
- Inventory - TAB key.

The goal of the game is to complete all the tasks, while annoying Granny. 

PC controls:  
WASD - move; 
Shift - run; 
Space - jump; 
E - put/take; 
F - interact; 
LMB - throw/shoot.  

Mobile device controls: 
Right swipe - camera movement; 
Left joystick - player movement.

An exciting and addictive pet catching simulator for pokemon lovers. Travel through different roblox worlds and a lot of leveling heroes in one place!

Collect health, upgrade your hero to explore the most amazing worlds of this game. Catch pets in battles, hatch them from cases and eggs, buy and exchange them to get the strongest helpers and friends. Earn money and upgrade your Obby character with the help of ranks and titles.

PC control:
AWSD - running;
Space - jump;
Tab - hide/show the cursor;
Mouse - turn.

On smartphones:
Joystick movement - running;
The up arrow is a jump.

Movement - WASD;
Use - E/LMB;
Hint - H;
Shop - C;
Inventory - TAB;
Choose Magic - 1-4 for quick actions.

The game uses intuitive controls, which makes it easy to master the game even for beginners.
On PC:

W - go forward;
A - go left;
S - go backwards;
D - go right.

On mobile devices, control is done with the joystick on the screen.

Controls for PC/Keyboard:

1. arrow keys "left" and "right" for movement;
2. arrow key "up" - jump;
3. key "V" - normal attack;
4. key "B" - Special skill, allowing a 30% increase in attack and defense for 15 seconds;
5. key "F" - Summon dragon;
6. keys "Z," "X," "C" - skill buttons providing powerful attacks (effect depends on the skill branches chosen).


Controls for mobile devices/touchscreen:

1. slider in the bottom left corner - for movement "left" and "right";
2. other control buttons are displayed on the screen.

PC Controls:
Move — W, A, S, D or Arrow Keys;
Jump — Space;
Run — Shift;
Crouch — C;
Interact — E;
Open Menu — Tab;
Open Inventory — I;
Zoom Camera — Right Mouse Button (RMB);
Bonus Speed from Ads — Z;
Bonus Jump Power from Ads — X.

Mobile Controls:
Move — Joystick;
Jump — Jump Button;
Run — Run Button;
Crouch — Crouch Button;
Rotate Camera — Right side of the screen;
Open Inventory — Button in the top-left corner;
Interact — Button with the "E" icon;
Open Menu — Button in the top-right corner.

Addictive and addictive lava racing simulator where you can pump up your Obby character for hours, buy cool cars and pass difficult parkours! Lots of cases and boxes and cool cars for tracks will help you have a great time!

Collect stars, charge a slingshot, dynamite or even an entire rocket with energy. Hatch pets from cases and eggs to get more energy. Earn money and pump up your hero with ranks and ranks.

PC controls:
AWSD - run;
Space - jump;
Escape - hide/show cursor;
Mouse - turn.

On smartphones:
Joystick movement - run;
Up arrow - jump.

Block Mine Fuse TNT  this is a story game set in a cubic world, a wonderful world captured by Herobrine. Help Nubik the fuse defeat Herobrine with TNT on a parachute and other arsenal. Pump up and drop TNT on Herobrine.

Free the world from Herobrine and its creepy buildings.
Upgrade and drop TNT, rockets and all your power on cubic settlements.
In the game you will find:
- 31 exciting unique levels;
- - storyline with a cube and a Herobrine;
- various types of TNT;
- Unique Survival mode, create your bases and repel attacks as much as you can;
- Desiccant, Ifrit, Gast, Vardan, Creeper and other bosses;
- New game +, after completing the game (all pumping remains from the last game);

Desktop controls:
WASD - move;
Space - jump;
LMB - shoot;
R - reload;
G - grenade
C - change camera

Mobile controls: touch/swipe.
